{"title":"Antlion Warrior","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 23 Antlion that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Raider%20Camp\">Raider Camp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"antlion-warrior\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Antlion: <a href=\"#/monster/antlion-pitling\">Antlion Pitling</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/antlion\">Antlion</a> <span class=\"muted\">(19)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/antlion-queen\">Antlion Queen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(25)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/5c7bdf1fc1fd8f79ddfb.webp\" alt=\"Antlion Warrior\"></div><h3>Antlion Warrior</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>23</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 23)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Antlion</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>79</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>17.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,150</td></tr>\n      <t